{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":314540,\"title\":\"The Romance of Zero Chance\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"After falling for Seol Ji Hui at first sight, Han Seung Yun lies about his identity and pretends to come out to stay close to her. To make the lie believable, he drags Chan Yeong into a fake relationship, turning his simple crush into a carefully constructed act that must be maintained in front of everyone.\\n\\nAs Seung Yun and Chan Yeong continue their staged romance, Ji Hui becomes increasingly involved in their lives. What begins as interest slowly deepens into real emotional attachment, complicating the dynamics between the three and blurring the boundary between performance and truth.\\n\\nThe story follows how the growing feelings, guilt, and tension threaten to expose the lie, forcing each of them to face the consequences of a romance that was never supposed to become real.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2joODMlNmV9oCaIOtqi8Zl5vTu7.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g2OyJnd6MO6NNI1ZSHJJgXQkHXO.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":50,\"createdBy\":[\"김재현\"],\"networks\":[\"Heavenly\",\"Shortime\",\"Shortcha\",\"KITZ\",\"Lezhin Snack\",\"DramaBox\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4985147,\"name\":\"Kim Na-young\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e339KOwgz23O3X4LvO3exZunuaw.jpg\"},{\"id\":2949423,\"name\":\"Kim Dong-hyun\",\"character\":\"Han Seung-yoon\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uAOwJMfZDzF8ZWTze8KDJZS0OUe.jpg\"},{\"id\":3640412,\"name\":\"Jeong Ji-soo\",\"character\":\"Seol Ji-hee\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a7iiiGSeAoIL7N7uvyW81AjjEuM.jpg\"},{\"id\":2977941,\"name\":\"Seo Ji-hoo\